## Tone — non-negotiable

> "Everything works without the app — the app just makes it faster."

`product-spec.md` fixes this tone, and it is the whole positioning: the free path is real and
complete, and the app sells time, not capability. A page that implies the manual path is crippled
contradicts the product.

